<title>EU: EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 23-SUNDAY, DEC 29.</title>
<headline>EC REPORT WEEKLY DIARY FOR MONDAY, DEC 23-SUNDAY, DEC 29.</headline>
<text>
